   "section": "mod-tome/class/interface/TooltipsData.lua",
   "line": 1579,
   "source": "#GOLD#Equilibrium#LAST#\nEquilibrium reflects your standing in the grand balance of nature and how easily you can access Wild Gifts.\nThe closer it is to 0 the more in-balance you are.\nBeing too far out of balance may cause your Wild Gifts to fail when called upon.\n",
   "target": "#GOLD#失衡值#LAST#\n失衡值反映了你在自然大平衡中所处的状态，以及你使用野性系技能的难易程度。\n失衡值越接近于0你破坏自然平衡的量越少。\n当你的失衡值过高时，你使用野性系技能时可能会失败。\n",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "occurrences": 1
  },
  {
   "revision_key": "entry-00373",
   "entry_id": "entry-00373",
   "file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "component": "tome",
   "section": "mod-tome/class/interface/TooltipsData.lua",
   "line": 1689,
   "source": "#GOLD#Passive Talents#LAST#\nWhen learned, passive talents permanently alter the user in some way.\nThe effects are always present and are usually not dispellable or removable, though other effects may counteract or negate them.\nSpecific information on each talent appears its tooltip.",
   "target": "#GOLD#被动技能#LAST#\n当你学会被动技能之后，它会以某种方式永久地改变技能的使用者。\n这些效果始终存在，通常不会被解除或移除，但是有些特殊效果可能会抵消或消除它们。\n有关技能的详细信息，请参阅技能的提示框。",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "occurrences": 1
